{"title":"AI in research","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/974002682/0/marginalrevolution~AI-in-research.html","date":1795632683000,"content":"<blockquote><p>We found that recent frontier models are now consistently proposing research designs that human and LLM graders alike judge more compelling than what the very top expert in the field has been developing. Yet these outstanding AI research designs are still often in service of new research questions that graders found substantially less valuable than leading research in political science.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://freesystems.substack.com/p/benchmarking-ais-research-taste-in\" target=\"_blank\">much more from Andy Hall and Andy Myers</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/ai-in-research.html\">AI in research</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/974002682/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/974002682/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/974002682/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/974002682/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/974002682/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/974002682/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https:/